  "_doc": "V3 visual-first (no TTS / voiceover / subtitles). Sorted 16-item array, target 72 (index 13). Binary finds it in 3 probes (mid 7 -> 11 -> 13); linear needs 14. Reactive text only (<= 4 words, pops on events, dims/clears), focal zoom + spotlight per action, event-only audio (no bed), engine-enforced clean envelopes. Continuous speed-coupled music bed; card tightened to 25-31 s with packet/spark micro-events (anti-dead-air).",
